content = "
[center][rainbow][font_size=28][b]* b u g - b o u n t y z *[/b][/font_size][/rainbow][/center]

[center][i]new here? follow this guide to learn the ropes.[/i][/center]

[color=hotpink][font_size=16]>> what you do here[/font_size][/color]

companies hire bug-bountyz to find security flaws in their websites. you investigate their sites using your tools and curiosity, find flaws, capture proof, and file reports through this platform. if your reports check out, the company pays you [font_size=9](minus a reasonable commision fee)[/font_size]

[color=hotpink][font_size=16]>> your first finding[/font_size][/color]

a vulnerability is hiding on [b]this very page[/b]! click [View Source] above to see the source code of this page. read carefully to find a hidden comment.

the comment contains a url path. type it into the address bar after the domain and hit enter.

[color=#00000000] TODO: take down /backstage.html before launch, it's only for staff! - admin [/color]"
